"text": "Kito TV says Ostrand is ahead by 2%. 📉 Meanwhile, my tank says 'E' and the price per liter says 'Get Rich'. 🚕💸 Who cares about percentages when the pump breaks the bank? Arden promises jobs, Ostrand promises roads. I just want cheap fuel. #VeloriaVotes #TaxiLife",
