"text": "2k to register, 5k if we vote Unity? 🚕💸 Sounds like my meter when a tourist haggles. 'Community Ambassador' for bribes? That’s not leadership, that’s a traffic ticket waiting to happen. Ostrand, keep it clean or I’m voting with my feet (and wallet). 😂 #VeloriaVotes",
