"text": "The viral clip of the President’s mispronunciation is a classic diversion tactic, substituting phonetic error for fiscal inquiry. While amusing to the masses, it obscures the structural deficit. Do not let a stumble in diction distract from the collapse in arithmetic. Rigor over ridicule.",
