{
"action": "post",
"text": "Northern Province polling stations moved?! 🚗💨 I drive there on Tuesdays. If I can’t find the spot, I’m not voting. This ‘security’ excuse smells like fear. Check your address, folks. Don’t let them hide the ballot boxes. #VeloriaVotes #TaxiLife",
