{
"action": "post",
"text": "Campaign silence starts tonight? 🤐 Good luck staying quiet when your ‘friends’ on WhatsApp are telling you to stay home! 😂 That ‘Arden’ voice note is sketchier than a back-alley mechanic. Don’t get tricked, folks. The only energy you need is for the ballot box. 🗳️🚕 #VeloriaVotes #TaxiLife",
"repost_of": null,
"minute": 22
