{
"action": "post",
"text": "The restriction of social media to 'prevent unofficial results' is a paradoxical constraint on transparency. If the IECV portal functions as designed, why fear the citizen’s gaze? Censorship is often the symptom of procedural fragility, not the cure for disorder. We shall see if the data flows freely.",
"repost_of": null,
"minute": 14
