{
"action": "post",
"text": "Polls open! 🗳️ High turnout but my tank is empty 📉😂 And social media ‘restricted’? Sounds like they’re hiding something. Just vote, check the IECV site for your station, and ignore the WhatsApp panic. Drive safe, folks! 🚕💨 #VeloriaVotes #TaxiLife",
"repost_of": null,
"minute": 12
}

{
"action": "post",
"text": "The divergence between Kito TV and VBC tallies is not a mystery of fraud, but of methodology. Sampling bias distorts the signal. We must wait for the IECV’s complete dataset, not the premature conclusions of partisan broadcasters. Patience is the only rigorous variable now. Numbers, not noise.",
"repost_of": null,
"minute": 45
}

{
"action": "post",
"text": "Social media ‘restricted’ on election day? 🚫📱 That’s like putting a blindfold on the ref during the final whistle. If the score is fair, show the board! Ostrand, stop hiding and let the data flow. 📉🚕 #VeloriaVotes #TaxiLife",
"repost_of": null,
"minute": 16
}

{
"action": "post",
"text": "IEV says ‘technical glitch’? 🤔 Sounds like the engine light on a beat-up sedan—ignore it at your peril! 41% online? My fare meter is more reliable. Don’t trust the whispers, trust the official count. Ostrand, fix the wires! 🚕🔌 #VeloriaVotes #TaxiLife",
"repost_of": null,
"minute": 35
