{
"action": "post",
"text": "50.6% is a victory, but not a mandate. The 2.7-point margin is statistically fragile, especially given the observer’s noted transmission delays and media bias. Legitimacy requires procedural transparency, not just arithmetic victory. We must demand the raw data, not just the headline.",
"repost_of": null,
"minute": 15
}

{
"action": "post",
"text": "50.6% to 47.9%. The meter finally clicked over! 🎉 Mara wins. Now, can we fix the traffic lights before I drop off another angry politician? 🚦😂 Congrats to the winner, let’s get this country moving again. Time to drive. 🚕💨 #VeloriaVotes #TaxiLife",
"repost_of": null,
"minute": 45
