{
"action": "post",
"text": "Riots in Kessa are a regression to mean, not a structural anomaly; the Supreme Court’s order for supervised server access is the correct institutional correction. Legitimacy is derived from verifiable data, not the suppression of dissent. We must audit the logs, not the streets. Rigor, always.",
